---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About Us | KD Plastering & Rendering Services"
  description="KD Plastering & Rendering Services — Bristol-based plastering, rendering and external wall insulation specialists. 10+ years experience, fully insured, 5-star rated."
  canonical="/about-us/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'About Us', href: '/about-us/' }]}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About KD Plastering &amp; Rendering Services</h1>
      <p class="lede">A well established Bristol plastering and rendering business, covering Bath and all surrounding areas.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <p>KD Plastering &amp; Rendering Services is a well established business within the heart of Bristol with coverage over Bath and all surrounding areas. We are specialists in all types of plastering, rendering and external wall insulation, with over 10 years of trade experience.</p>

      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>We deliver professional plastering, rendering and external wall insulation to homeowners, landlords and developers across the BS and BA postcode areas. Our services include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Internal plastering — boarding, skimming, Artex removal, patch plastering, screeding</li>
        <li>External rendering — silicone, monocouche, acrylic, sand-and-cement</li>
        <li>External wall insulation (EWI) — BBA-approved systems with 25-year manufacturer warranty</li>
        <li>Pebbledash removal and re-rendering</li>
        <li>Heritage and lime-render work</li>
        <li>Commercial rendering</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>Every quote is free, written and fixed. We use only BBA-accredited systems from Johnstone’s, Parex, K Rend and Weber. Every installation comes with a 10-year workmanship warranty as standard, plus the relevant manufacturer system warranty (typically 25 years for silicone and EWI).</p>

      <h2>Accreditations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Checkatrade approved with 180+ verified five-star reviews</li>
        <li>TrustATrader member</li>
        <li>£2m public liability insurance</li>
        <li>Johnstone’s, Parex, K Rend and Weber approved installer</li>
        <li>BBA-approved system specifications</li>
        <li>Full public liability and employer’s liability cover</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Where we work</h2>
      <p>Based in Hanham (Bristol BS15), we cover 20 neighbourhoods across Bristol and Bath — 15 in Bristol (including Hanham, Brislington, Kingswood, Downend, Emerson's Green, Stapleton, Frenchay, Fishponds, Knowle, St George and more) and 5 in Bath (Bath City Centre, Bathwick, Widcombe, Newbridge, Odd Down). Each service page lists the full coverage and pricing for your specific area.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Get a free quote for your project</h2>
      <p>Free site visit, fixed written quote, no pressure.</p>
      <a href="/#lead-form-heading">Get Your Free Quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
